  "cited_article_id": "configure-automated-reminders",
  "reply": "To troubleshoot missing reminders, first open each patient’s profile and confirm the communication opt‑in is enabled. Then go to **Reports > Message Log** and look for a ‘Failed’ status; if it’s due to carrier blocking, verify the phone number supports SMS. For persistent failures, provide the patient ID and timestamp to support. To update wording and timing, navigate to **Settings > Communications > Reminders**, select **Edit** next to SMS or Email, modify the template using allowed merge tags (e.g., [PatientName], [AppointmentTime]), set the dispatch window between 24‑72 hours before the visit, and click **Save Changes**."
}
